{
  "title": "Sheet Pan Lemon Herb Chicken Breast and Asparagus - Easy Meal Prep",
  "description": "Make this sheet pan lemon herb chicken breast and asparagus for an easy 25-minute high protein dinner. Fresh lemon, garlic, and herbs flavor lean chicken and tender-crisp vegetables on one pan. Save it for your next meal prep.",
  "cuisine": "American",
